            "title": "Features",
            "collapsed": false,
            "entries": [
              "- **`slopper video` puts a promo video on a slop.** `slopper video <slop> promo.mp4` uploads an MP4 or WebM (up to 4 MB) and puts it on the slop, replacing its last; `--remove` takes it off. It reports `pending` until a moderator approves it.\n  _Owner:_ Ifiok Jr. · _Introduced in:_ 27c54b3"
